<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="pre-raid-best-in-slot">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c9" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/achievement_dungeon_gloryofthehero.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Pre-Raid Best in Slot for Demonology Warlock</span></h2>This is an example of the Best in Slot gear available from all PvE sources before entering a raid. While this gear may technically be the best available without raiding, it is unlikely that you will have or need all of these items before entering your first raid, and as you gain raid gear, your priorities will shift. Especially the Valor-based reputation items, most likely you will be using Celestial Dungeon gear long before having access to most of these.<div class="clear exclude-units"></div>
<div class="tabs-wrapper exclude-units uniform-width">
<div id="dsf67g4d-bis-lists">
<div class="tabs-container">
<ul class="tabs" role="tablist" tabindex="0">
