<div>
<span class="icontiny" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/small/inv_legendarygem_05.jpg");'></span>MSV Release</div>
<b>
<span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_legendarygem_05.gif");'></span>MSV Release</b></a></li>
