<div class="tabbed-contents">
<div class="exclude-units" id="tab-bis-lists-pre-raid-opening" role="tabpanel" style="" tabindex="0">This list represents the best gear available in Mists of Pandaria Classic before <b>Celestial Dungeons</b> and raids become accessible. It does <b>not</b> include any <b>raid gear</b>, <b>world boss loot</b>, or <b>Celestial gear</b>. Additionally, <b>Valor gear</b> is limited to a maximum of <b>3,200 Valor</b>.<br/>
<br/>
