<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="heroic-dungeon-gear">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c9" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/pvecurrency-valor.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Heroic Dungeon Gear for Demonology Warlock</span></h2>This list represents the best gear available strictly from Heroic Dungeons in Phase 1 of Mists of Pandaria Classic. However, it is essential to remember that because other gear may be obtained at a higher item level from raids, crafting, World Bosses, etc., it is not an actual "best in slot" list. Instead, it's more of a rough guideline, and players should sim the gear they have available to them to determine their best combination of stats and effects.<br/>
<br/>
