<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="world-drops">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c9" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/expansionicon_mistsofpandaria.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best World Drop Items for Demonology Warlock</span></h2>Mists of Pandaria brings a wealth of world content, offering the chance to acquire powerful gear. This includes Rare Mobs, like <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=50350/morgrinn-crackfang">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Morgrinn Crackfang</span></a>, but also World Bosses such as <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=60491/sha-of-anger">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Sha of Anger</span></a>.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="galleons-warband">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c9" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_mushanbeastmount.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Galleon's Warband</span></h3>World Boss drops have a much higher item level than Valor or Reputation gear, making them excellent pre-Raid upgrades. These pieces often replace gear listed above and should be used unless they break a Tier 14 set bonus.<br/>
<br/>Galleon's Warband is notable because it drops some of our best pieces in <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90435/ring-of-wretched-flames">
<img alt="Ring of Wretched Flames" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_145.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ring of Wretched Flames</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90430/stomphowl-pendant">
<img alt="Stomphowl Pendant" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_108.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Stomphowl Pendant</span></a>.<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90449/belt-of-detonation">
<img alt="Belt of Detonation" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_cloth_raidwarlock_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Belt of Detonation</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90439/open-steppe-sandals">
<img alt="Open Steppe Sandals" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boot_bracer_raidmage_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Open Steppe Sandals</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90418/robes-of-the-lightning-rider">
<img alt="Robes of the Lightning Rider" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_robe_raidmage_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Robes of the Lightning Rider</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90409/sky-sear-cowl">
<img alt="Sky-Sear Cowl" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_cloth_raidwarlock_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sky-Sear Cowl</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90435/ring-of-wretched-flames">
<img alt="Ring of Wretched Flames" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_145.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ring of Wretched Flames</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90429/necklace-of-imbued-fury">
<img alt="Necklace of Imbued Fury" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_95.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Necklace of Imbued Fury</span></a></div></li></ul>
<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="sha-of-anger">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c9" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/sha_spell_fire_felfirenova.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Sha of Anger</span></h3>The <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=60491/sha-of-anger">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Sha of Anger</span></a> is a valuable early target, as it drops <b>item level 496</b> Tier 14 <b>Legs</b> and <b>Gloves</b>, along with various <b>item level 483 Malevolent Gladiator</b> PvP pieces. If you're lucky, this can give you a strong head start on your Tier set.<br/>
<br/>While primarily PvP gear, some of the <b>Malevolent Gladiator's</b> items can be upgrades in PvE depending on your current gear. Be sure to check your options using the <a href="https://www.wowsims.com/mop/warlock/demonology/#" target="_blank">Demonology Warlock Sim</a> to see what's best.<br/>
<br/>Additionally, the first time you kill the Sha of Anger, it will drop <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=89317/claw-of-anger">
<img alt="Claw of Anger" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_hand_1h_shaclaw.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Claw of Anger</span></a>, which can be turned in for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90913/sandals-of-the-shadow">
<img alt="Sandals of the Shadow" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_cloth_reputation_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sandals of the Shadow</span></a>, a solid pair of early boots to help round out your gearing.<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=85369/sha-skin-gloves">
<img alt="Sha-Skin Gloves" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_glove_cloth_raidwarlock_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sha-Skin Gloves</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=85371/sha-skin-leggings">
<img alt="Sha-Skin Leggings" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_cloth_raidwarlock_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sha-Skin Leggings</span></a></div></li></ul>
<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="rare-mobs">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c9" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/expansionicon_mistsofpandaria.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Rare Mobs</span></h3>There are tons of Rare mobs scattered around Pandaria, and each one has a unique drop. Most of these are toys, cosmetics, or similar items, but a small handful can drop strong equipment.<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=50338/kornas-nightsavage">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Kor'nas Nightsavage</span></a> drops <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=87642/darkstaff-of-annihilation">
<img alt="Darkstaff of Annihilation" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_staff_2h_pandung_c_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Darkstaff of Annihilation</span></a>, a ilvl 440 Weapon</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=50768/cournith-waterstrider">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Cournith Waterstrider</span></a> drops <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90721/cournith-waterstriders-silken-finery">
<img alt="Cournith Waterstrider's Silken Finery" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_cloth_reputation_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cournith Waterstrider's Silken Finery</span></a>, ilvl 440 Leggings</div></li></ul>
<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="reputation">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c9" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/achievement_faction_shadopan_assault.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best Reputation Items for Demonology Warlock</span></h2>Reputation gear is strong, but prioritizing the proper factions is key. Demonology Warlocks should focus on <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1337/the-klaxxi">
<span class="tinyicontxt">The Klaxxi</span></a> to get your hands on the Tailoring patterns for the Spelltwister's Gloves and Chest, as well as the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=89068/wire-of-the-wakener">
<img alt="Wire of the Wakener" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_94.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Wire of the Wakener</span></a>, all at honored. If you reach Exalted early, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90859/seal-of-the-lucid">
<img alt="Seal of the Lucid" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_147.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Seal of the Lucid</span></a> is a solid ring until raid gear replaces it.<br/>
<br/>Since Valor is capped early on, you won't be able to buy many items before your first raid; focus on these as your initial priorities.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="the-klaxxi">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c9" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/achievement_faction_klaxxi.jpg");'></ins>
